{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12301200","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12301200","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1230120001:1":{"text":"네. 다들 빨리 바다에 나가기 위해서죠. 급하다고 하는데, 급해도 순서는 지켜야 하니까요.","source_cn":"是的，想要修船出海的人实在太多。每个人都说急，可再怎么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F82F36465B790F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1230120002:1":{"text":"생선 가격 때문에 급하다고! 시장 가격이 계속 변하고 있단 말일세. 시간은 금이야!","source_cn":"我是着急鱼的价格！现在鱼市的鱼价一天一变，时间就是金钱！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4726D6AA510CFC47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1230120003:1":{"text":"시간이 금이라고요? 그럼 지금까진 대체 뭘 하고 계셨나요?","source_cn":"时间就是金钱？那之前你去干什么了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4473AFE6FF8FCC6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1230120004:1":{"text":"배를 수리하고 싶으면 조용히 규칙대로 뒤로 가서 줄 서세요!","source_cn":"想要我修船，就守规矩，给我闭嘴去后面排好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4BCE14870054B1C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:工匠埃隆阿":{"text":"장인 에로나","source":"工匠埃隆阿","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:渔夫塔富林":{"text":"어부 테이린","source":"渔夫塔富林","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}